    <!-- Weapon names, indexed by eWeapon enum value. Base ids 0..20
         come from Aru's ScriptHook SDK
         (violetfrost/gtaiv-scripthook-sdk, ScriptHook/ScriptingEnums.h);
         the TLAD/TBoGT additions 21..41 (WEAPON_EPISODIC_1..21) are
         from PliskinDev/GTAIV/enums.h, cross-checked against
         ClonkAndre/ClonksCodingLib.GTAIV. A few DLC ids are
         vehicle-only (helicopter rockets, APC cannon) or
         undocumented; those stay as "weapon N" because they should
         never land in the player's wheel.

         Brand/model names (Desert Eagle, Micro-SMG, MP5, AK-47, M4,
